  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Experimental preview: fixes scoped repeat/release routing after an unhandled first Down. Commands no longer activate partway through a native press after focus or eligibility changes; observers still receive the full sequence. Retains Android Activity and Windows preview/pointer capture, scoped routing, native metadata, eight platform assets and browser module. Physical peripherals, full lifecycle, post-fix Windows Select runtime and MAUI 11 runtime acceptance remain unverified. Not production-ready.",
